# Test My Mettle (otherAreas 25): the timer edges, 122 / 123 / 125, the repeat after a completion, and the vars 123
# leaves behind. now = 1800000000. Accepted (a GM), Reward 777 (a GM), the Power Sandals and a Chocobo Feather held.
# The feather traded: nil (not the sandals); the sandals with the feather: nil (not exactly the sandals); both kept.
# Timer now + 144: Devean 121 (the sandals, 1); now + 143: 121 (the sandals, 0: floored). Timer now + 1: the sandals
# traded: 122; finished: completed, 777 gil, the sandals taken, fame +5 x2, the vars cleared, Repeat = JstMidnight();
# Devean 124 (no section).
# The repeat (a Lua quirk, kept): a JST day later, completed: 120; option 1001: 1000 gil taken, Timer and Reward set,
# quest:begin's addQuest sets the current bit, but getQuestStatus answers completed while the completed bit is set (the
# engine's order, as LSB's C++), so the quest is never accepted again: Devean 120 again, and the sandals traded: no
# section 2: nothing, kept.
# A GM then makes it available and accepted (the completed bit cleared). Timer = now (a GM; the timer is over at 0): the
# sandals held, Option 0: 125; finished: Option 1. Again: 123; finished: no trade to confirm, delCurrentQuest (available:
# no completed bit), Repeat = JstMidnight(); Timer, Reward and Option kept. 124 until a JST day later: 120, option 1001,
# begun: Option is still 1: with the timer over and the sandals held, 123 (not 125); finished: off the current list,
# the sandals kept. Accepted again (a GM), the sandals traded with the timer over: 123; finished: the sandals taken
# (confirmTrade). Accepted again, Option 0 (a GM), no sandals: 123.
lists Selbina/Devean/onTrigger Selbina/Devean/onTrade Selbina/onEventFinish/120 Selbina/onEventFinish/122 Selbina/onEventFinish/123 Selbina/onEventFinish/125
char zone=Selbina pos=41.4,-14.6,40 job=WAR lvl=10 nation=1 gil=5000
rank 2
fame Sandoria 75
quest OtherAreas.TestMyMettle accepted
charvar Quest[4][25]Reward 777
item PowerSandals
item ChocoboFeather
login
trade Devean ChocoboFeather x1          # not the sandals: nil
trade Devean PowerSandals x1 ChocoboFeather x1 # not exactly the sandals: nil; both kept
charvar Quest[4][25]Timer 1800000144    # a GM
trigger Devean                          # 144 s left: 121 (Power Sandals, 1)
finish
charvar Quest[4][25]Timer 1800000143
trigger Devean                          # 143 s left: 121 (Power Sandals, 0)
finish
charvar Quest[4][25]Timer 1800000001
trade Devean PowerSandals x1            # 1 s left: 122
finish                                  # completed; the sandals taken; 777 gil; fame +5 x2; vars cleared; Repeat = JstMidnight()
trigger Devean                          # Repeat in the future: 124
finish
wait jst=1
trigger Devean                          # completed, Repeat passed: 120
finish option=1001                      # 1000 gil taken; Timer now + 144; Reward 3000; addQuest: still completed
trigger Devean                          # the completed bit wins: 120 again (not 121)
finish option=0
item PowerSandals                       # a GM
trade Devean PowerSandals x1            # completed: no section 2: nothing; kept
quest OtherAreas.TestMyMettle available # a GM: both bits cleared
quest OtherAreas.TestMyMettle accepted  # a GM
charvar Quest[4][25]Timer 1800086400    # a GM: Timer = now
trigger Devean                          # 0 left, the sandals held, Option 0: 125
finish                                  # Option 1
trigger Devean                          # Option 1: 123
finish                                  # no trade; delCurrentQuest (available); Repeat = JstMidnight(); Timer, Reward, Option kept
trigger Devean                          # Repeat in the future: 124
finish
wait jst=1
trigger Devean                          # 120
finish option=1001                      # begun; Timer now + 144; Reward 3000; Option still 1
charvar Quest[4][25]Timer 1800172800    # a GM: Timer = now
trigger Devean                          # the sandals held, but Option 1: 123
finish                                  # off the current list again; the sandals kept
quest OtherAreas.TestMyMettle accepted  # a GM
trade Devean PowerSandals x1            # 0 left: 123
finish                                  # the sandals taken (confirmTrade); off the current list
quest OtherAreas.TestMyMettle accepted  # a GM
charvar Quest[4][25]Option 0            # a GM
trigger Devean                          # no sandals, Option 0: 123
finish
